f5", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-c8a71ef25a1f2f34232a194b", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/c157a9ac17c648746d8bd8ef73ebb55e50be4101e863caa4551e4f49cfd1968a.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "c157a9ac17c648746d8bd8ef73ebb55e50be4101e863caa4551e4f49cfd1968a", "user_turn_count": 3, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 335], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "d297482512fa60bec39166d96bde9f660ce580545a87228d7e57b3538718a98b", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 344], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "dd298048f2963ad1af6b1b7f7027ffb1bba16a26a597af63feae8b74515c0bb0", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 35], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "808998fe2e64da39d17900bfa7170802bfff40136746b60374f7cfe965e8201e", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "*附件顺序（原消息）：解析图 `assets/Q04_19334_solution.png`；题目图 `assets/Q04_19334_question.png`。*\n\n这个题我完全忘记怎么做了。它这里是对 $t$ 求导吧？\n\n那它对 $t$ 求导，它这个 $z$ 它不是一个 $t$ 的单项式，它是个函数，这函数有 $x$ 跟 $y$ 对吧？那这个 $z$ 对 $t$ 的导数，是不是 $f$ 对第一个位置求偏导，乘以第一个位置对 $t$ 的导数，再加上 $f$ 对第二个位置求偏导，乘以第二个位置对 $t$ 的导数？\n\n它是不是写这个形式？然后把这点代进去，应该是这么写这道题的。还是说它怎么写这道题，我有点忘记了。\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"m016\"></a>"}